    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "15fbad13_f8f285b3",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/ec_key.rs",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 63,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T08:33:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `generate_key` succeeds, I don\u0027t think the generated key pair can ever fail the check. I think it doesn\u0027t hurt to perform all these checks [1].\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/h/github/freebsd/freebsd-src/+/main:crypto/openssl/crypto/ec/ec_key.c;l\u003d572;drc\u003db077aed33b7b6aefca7b17ddb250cf521f938613",
      "parentUuid": "e7c08b51_69913f52",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "a12cc8976088cec5297adc0c92d3226f410b8db3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "16ef4790_8eddb4f0",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/ec_key.rs",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 87,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T13:47:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that it\u0027s the code here that both generates the key and signs it, why do we need to include the key type in the serialization?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "a12cc8976088cec5297adc0c92d3226f410b8db3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c9fdb4bf_3e8ba71a",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/ec_key.rs",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 87,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T15:28:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do you mean by \"signing\" it?\n\nThe private key generated here is encrypted and sent to rkpd. It\u0027ll be fetched later during the client VM attestation for signing.",
      "parentUuid": "16ef4790_8eddb4f0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "a12cc8976088cec5297adc0c92d3226f410b8db3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4cdb66b4_9a8da318",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/ec_key.rs",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 87,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T15:35:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, we generate it, then later we sign with it. No other party can access it, nor substitute a different key.\n\nSo we know the one we get back is the one we generated, so we know its exact type.",
      "parentUuid": "c9fdb4bf_3e8ba71a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "a12cc8976088cec5297adc0c92d3226f410b8db3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5530bf22_5f912e7d",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/ec_key.rs",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 87,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T08:33:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e ... we generate it, then later we sign with it.\n\nRight. Considering that the private key is not immediately consumed but obtained at a later time, it would be more reliable to obtain the DER encoding along with other relevant information. So we can perform additional checks, such as ensuring that the private key corresponds to the public key covered in the certificate.",
      "parentUuid": "4cdb66b4_9a8da318",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "a12cc8976088cec5297adc0c92d3226f410b8db3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
